WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.802
Dyoro baji, tɛmɛyɔrɔ. Lobi ka maana dɔ lo.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.586
Volta finman be woyo, a fanin lo ani dibi lo. Lobiw b'a miiri ko a ye koo dɔ kɛ min ɲɔgɔn ma deli ka kɛ.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.056
Wagati tɛmɛninw na, dugukolo tun tɛ se ka domuni di mɔgɔ si ma kɔrɔn fɛ.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.316
Dekan y'a ka mɔgɔw lajɛn. An tun ka ɲi ka taga. O kɔ, baji dɔrɔn le tun be yen.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:10.170
U tagara se bada la. Kɔgɔji tun ka ca, nka kongosogow tun b'a kɔnɔna.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.322
Mɔgɔ si tun t'a fɛ k'o kɛ. Cɛkɔrɔba dɔ nana jii daa la a kelen.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:35.330
Njiba, a to i deenw ka tɛmɛ. An bɛna na i fo, anw ni i denw.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:48.410
O yɔrɔnin bɛɛ, yeelen bɔra ji kan; jikuruw lɔra ka suma.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:01.018
U donna baji kɔnɔ n'u bolo ye. Deen tun be cɛɛw kun na.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:13.376
U tun b'u filɛra ka tɛmɛ, nka u ma foyi kɛ.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:35.666
K'u to tileben fan fɛ bada la, u sera yɔrɔ kura dɔ la. U ye barika la baji ye.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:05.474
Saan caaman o kɔ, kanbelew ni sunguruw y'o fɔ. O ye Dyoro ye, o kɔrɔ ko kɔnɔgwɛ.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:21.786
Koo minw be kɛra o yɔrɔ la, u tɛ lɔn. An b'a lɔn dɔrɔn ko o bɛ taga dogo ra, i n'a fɔ o bɛmaw.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:43.810
O kɔ, u yɛlɛmana. Dugu mɔgɔw b'u kunbɛn ni dɔnkiliw ye.

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:15.708
U tɛmɛna, i n'a fɔ anw.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:24.898
O kɔ, wulada fɛ, cɛkɔrɔbaw tagara sigi bada ra. Jii hakili b'a la.
